{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07761","headline":"初出关旅亭夜坐怀王大校书 · 孟浩然","name":"初出关旅亭夜坐怀王大校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向夕槐烟起，葱茏池馆曛。\n客中无偶坐，关外惜离羣。\n烛至萤光灭，荷枯雨滴闻。\n永怀芸阁友，寂寞滞[扬]云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}